          <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none" set:html={enBody} />

          <hr class="my-12 border-gray-200" />

          <section class="mt-8">
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2"><strong>Disclosure:</strong> APIRank is an independent comparison site. Pricing data verified against Anthropic's official launch post, platform.claude.com pricing page, and API release notes on 2026-11-10. We may earn affiliate commission when you sign up through links on this page, at no extra cost to you.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500"><strong>Last verified:</strong> 2026-11-10. Claude Fable 5.2 and Mythos 5.2 pricing, model IDs, and API behavior verified against Anthropic's November 9, 2026 launch announcement and the Claude Platform release notes on the date above. Pricing, cache rates, fast-mode availability, and prefix-check enforcement can change — re-check before committing to a production workload.</p>
          </section>
        </div>

        <aside class="lg:col-span-1">
          <div class="sticky top-4 space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Quick Reference</h3>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
                <li><strong>Models:</strong> Claude Fable 5.2 (<code>claude-fable-5-2</code>), Claude Mythos 5.2 (<code>claude-mythos-5-2</code>)</li>
                <li><strong>Price:</strong> $8 / $40 per MTok</li>
                <li><strong>Fast mode:</strong> 2.5x, $16 / $80 per MTok</li>
                <li><strong>Context:</strong> 1M tokens</li>
                <li><strong>Max output:</strong> 128K tokens</li>
                <li><strong>Thinking:</strong> adaptive, always on</li>
                <li><strong>Batch:</strong> 50% off ($4 / $20)</li>
                <li><strong>Cache hit:</strong> $0.20 / MTok</li>
                <li><strong>Launched:</strong> 2026-11-09</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Related Reviews</h3>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
                <li><a href="/tutorials/claude-fable-5-1-mythos-5-1-2026/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Claude Fable 5.1 API Review</a></li>
                <li><a href="/tutorials/claude-messages-api-threads-beta-2026/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Claude Messages API Threads</a></li>
                <li><a href="/tutorials/anthropic-claude-api-review/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Anthropic Claude API Review</a></li>
                <li><a href="/tutorials/gpt-6-1-terra-vs-claude-opus-5-5-2026/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">GPT-6.1 Terra vs Claude Opus 5.5</a></li>
              </ul>
